### Mini Tasks HTTP — V1..V4
@base = http://localhost:8080

### V1 - sin ResponseEntity
GET {{base}}/v1/ping

###
GET {{base}}/v1/sample

###
GET {{base}}/v1/tasks

###
POST {{base}}/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Tarea V1" }

### V2 - con ResponseEntity
GET {{base}}/v2/sample

###
POST {{base}}/v2/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Tarea V2" }

### V3 - Repo directo
GET {{base}}/v3/tasks

###
POST {{base}}/v3/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Persistida V3" }

###
PATCH {{base}}/v3/tasks/1/toggle

###
DELETE {{base}}/v3/tasks/1

### V4 - Service + extra
# Caching
GET {{base}}/v4/tasks

### Intento 304 (ajusta el ETag con el que devuelva la petición anterior)
GET {{base}}/v4/tasks
If-None-Match: "tasks-2"

### Paginado + búsqueda
GET {{base}}/v4/tasks?page=0&size=2&sort=title,asc&q=spring

### HEAD (sólo cabeceras)
HEAD {{base}}/v4/tasks?page=0&size=10

### PUT update
PUT {{base}}/v4/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Nueva V4", "done": true }

### DELETE
DELETE {{base}}/v4/tasks/9999
